/P 109 0 R
/E (At its core, PlantForge leverages a decentralized, event-driven microservices architecture to ingest and synthesize this vast array of plant data into a cohesive, highly structured Neo4j knowledge graph. By blending deterministic data parsing with state-of-the-art artificial intelligence, the platform moves beyond basic document retrieval. It features a proprietary multi-path graph reasoning engine \(PathRAG\), hybrid deterministic-semantic P&ID extractors, and a sophisticated ecosystem of collaborative, LLM-powered agents.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
