/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (The industrial sector is facing a "Knowledge Cliff." As 25% of the experienced workforce approaches retirement, plants are left with decades of fragmented, unstructured data that no single person can navigate. PlantForge enters the market as a high-fidelity intelligence layer that "forges" siloed data \(P&IDs, SOPs, Work Orders\) into a living Neo4j Knowledge Graph. By leveraging PathRAG and Collaborative Agentic Workflows, PlantForge reduces search time by 35% and unplanned downtime by an estimated 20%, transforming document management from a cost center into a strategic safety and efficiency asset.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
