/E (3.2 The Multimodal Extraction Deficit : Industrial knowledge is not purely textual; it is highly visual and spatial. Standard extraction pipelines fail to process the spatial relationships in heterogeneous formats. For instance, in a Piping and Instrumentation Diagram \(P&ID\) or a complex tabular spec sheet, the relationship between a header and a value is defined by visual proximity \(bounding boxes and lines\), not reading order. Research by Mani et al. \(2020\) and subsequent studies on Document AI \(2024\) emphasize that text-only OCR entirely strips this spatial context, resulting in extracted text that is a disorganized "soup" of words disconnected from their originating equipment tags [9].)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
