/P 113 0 R
/E (Research into Industrial Knowledge Graphs \(IKG\) by Zhang et al. \(2024\) demonstrates that without robust deterministic rules and domain-specific ontology mapping, automated extractors treat these variations as entirely distinct entities [10]. This creates "fragmented subgraphs." If an engineer searches for the failure history of P-101A, a system lacking advanced entity resolution will entirely miss the critical maintenance log that referred to it as PMP-101-A-00.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
