497 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E (When the operator opens the alert and asks, the request resolves at stage 3 of the pipeline as a cosine comparison against pre-computed entries. The answer returns essentially instantly at zero additional inference cost, because the reasoning was performed at write time rather than read time.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
