/E (What makes this worth doing properly, rather than handing out a database connection, is that the discipline travels with the data. Every result carries the same citations to real documents, the same confidence signal, and the same engineer corrections that overrule the records they were filed against. An assistant given raw query access would produce confident unsourced claims about pressure vessels. An assistant given these tools cannot, because every path to the data returns the evidence with it.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [21]
>>
