/P 123 0 R
/E (This is the application layer that manages the lifecycle of the interview. It takes an incoming employee profile, coordinates the Context Builder to fetch the plant history, spins up the Pipecat voice pipeline, manages the background agenda generation, and coordinates the final handover document generation when the call ends.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
