/P 129 0 R
/E (PlantForge addresses a problem routinely misfiled as document management. Thirty-five percent of engineering hours lost to searching, eighteen to twenty-two percent of unplanned downtime traced to fragmented knowledge, and a quarter of India's experienced engineers retiring within the decade are not filing inefficiencies they are a safety, compliance and reliability problem that compounds annually.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
